WEBVTT

00:04:57.858 --> 00:05:00.978
that contributes 7.5 percent to the GDP.

00:05:01.378 --> 00:05:02.558
In contrast,

00:05:02.578 --> 00:05:06.278
data from 2019 showed
that one developed nation

00:05:06.298 --> 00:05:10.358
was able to get 10 percent
of its GDP contribution

00:05:10.378 --> 00:05:12.398
from the power of the internet,

00:05:12.438 --> 00:05:14.198
not technology more broadly,

00:05:14.238 --> 00:05:15.378
the internet.

00:05:16.138 --> 00:05:17.958
Can you imagine what would happen

00:05:17.998 --> 00:05:20.798
if more people had access to the internet?

00:05:22.058 --> 00:05:23.758
And lest we forget,

00:05:23.778 --> 00:05:27.558
access to the internet
would give Chomba in my home village

00:05:27.578 --> 00:05:28.978
the right to learn.

00:05:28.998 --> 00:05:30.838
She would be able to go to school